  "description": "Defense-in-depth file upload pipeline for ASP.NET Core 10+. Eight serial validation layers (size, extension allowlist, MIME / extension cross-check, magic bytes, filename inspection, deep structural content validation including FlateDecode-PDF stream inspection, virus scan via Windows Defender or ClamAV, encrypted storage). Storage uses AES-256-GCM envelope encryption with a per-file random DEK wrapped under an Argon2id-derived master KEK (RFC 9106 / OWASP 2026 recommendation). Includes a hardened reference download controller and a SharpFuzz / AFL++ harness for the deep content validator.",
